01:21:22,739 --> 01:21:32,719
In preview and read the paragraph closely, you probably will find that you need to read the paragraph more than once.

299
01:21:33,380 --> 01:21:33,639
Right?

300
01:21:33,939 --> 01:21:36,800
So you have to read the paragraph more than once.

301
01:21:37,099 --> 01:21:37,319
Why?

302
01:21:37,439 --> 01:21:41,739
Because you need to catch the main point there the authors try to give you.

303
01:21:42,619 --> 01:21:44,500
And make a list or outline.

304
01:21:45,079 --> 01:21:48,519
Determine the main idea and the supporting details of the paragraph.

305
01:21:49,340 --> 01:21:51,979
Make a list or outline of these ideas.

306
01:21:51,979 --> 01:21:53,960
Be sure to use your own words.

307
01:21:54,800 --> 01:21:54,880
Right?

308
01:21:55,760 --> 01:21:57,219
And write a summary.

309
01:21:57,819 --> 01:22:01,000
