310
01:22:01,979 --> 01:22:05,420
State the main ideas followed by the important ideas.

311
01:22:05,599 --> 01:22:07,960
Limit your summary to just one or two sentences.

312
01:22:08,139 --> 01:22:09,079
This is very important.

313
01:22:09,300 --> 01:22:11,579
You have to limit the idea there.

314
01:22:11,699 --> 01:22:11,840
Okay?

315
01:22:11,960 --> 01:22:16,779
