320
01:22:38,819 --> 01:22:48,619
You don't need it in your summary because just focusing on the main points of the topic there is enough for a summary paragraph.

321
01:22:48,619 --> 01:22:52,599
And you reread aloud and correct.

322
01:22:52,599 --> 01:22:55,399
Read the summary aloud, correcting any mistakes.

323
01:22:55,579 --> 01:22:55,699
